DeepSeek-V4-Flash on 2x DGX Spark, on upstream-lineage vLLM

Copyright (c) 2026 Murai Labs

This repository contains measurement data, reproducibility scripts, deployment
configuration and two small source patches for serving DeepSeek-V4-Flash-0731
across two NVIDIA DGX Spark (GB10, sm_121) nodes.

It is a third-party contribution. It is NOT an official DeepSeek, vLLM, NVIDIA
or FlashInfer release, and no endorsement by any of them is implied.

Model weights and tokenizer are NOT included in this repository.

This work builds directly on prior community work -- notably MiaAI-Lab's
2x DGX Spark recipe and benchmark harness, and eugr's sm_12x build harness and
prebuilt b12x container image. The benchmark numbers published here were
produced with MiaAI-Lab's benchmark-0731.py, used unmodified. See the Credits
section of README.md for full attribution.

